            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
              Due to natural variances in spring wire batches, coil heat treatment, and handle mounting depths, two grippers with identical factory stamps can differ by <strong>10 to 15+ lbs RGC</strong>. A "hard" CoC #2 can overlap an "easy" #2.5!
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 p-3 rounded-lg bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] text-[11px] font-mono text-[var(--text-subtle)] border border-[var(--border-color)]">
              Cross-Brand Unification:<br/>
              CoC &bull; GHP &bull; Baraban &bull; Heavy Grips<br/>
              Mapped to one single poundage scale
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] pt-3 border-t border-[var(--border-color)]">
            Rating enables athletes to find micro-increments (e.g. 112 lb GHP Level 6) to bridge massive 20+ lb gaps between milestone grippers.
          </p>
        </div>

