          Sanctioning a Contest & <span class="text-[var(--accent-gold)]">Event Tracking Criteria</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          GSI sanctioning standardizes rules, qualifies lifters for the annual World's Strongest Grip competition, and incorporates lifts into the global database. Sourced directly from GSI sanctioning guidelines on <a href="https://gripsportint.com/resources" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent-gold)] underline font-medium">gripsportint.com/resources</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Sanctioning Steps & Tiers -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
        
        <!-- Step 1 Notification -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--bg-surface)] border border-[var(--border-color)] shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] border border-[var(--border-color)] flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xs text-[var(--accent-gold)] mb-3">
