            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] border border-[var(--border-color)] flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xs text-[var(--accent-gold)] mb-3">
              02
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg uppercase text-[var(--text-main)] mb-2">
              Sanctioning Tiers
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Each discipline in the contest is reviewed and designated with one of three official status codes:
            </p>
            <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
              <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-[var(--text-main)]">
                <span class="font-bold text-amber-500 font-mono">Full Sanctioning (F):</span> Qualifies for World's Strongest Grip + logged in world rankings database. Requires certified scale weighing of all apparatus, plates, collars, and spacers.
              </div>
              <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-[var(--text-main)]">
