              03
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg uppercase text-[var(--text-main)] mb-2">
              Database Criteria for Events
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
              To prevent devaluing records by proliferating niche tools, GSI enforces strict criteria before tracking a new implement:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--text-main)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-[var(--accent-gold)] font-bold">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong>25-Lift Threshold:</strong> Must register at least 25 competition lifts across sanctioned contests.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-[var(--accent-gold)] font-bold">&bull;</span>
                <span><strong>Commercially Available:</strong> The implement must be open for purchase by any lifter.</span>
