          Contest directors can choose between two recognized scoring systems and loading formats. Official day-of-contest procedures specify exact attempt flow, scoresheet marking, and post-contest reporting.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Loading Formats & Scoring Systems Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
        
        <!-- Loading Formats -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--bg-surface)] border border-[var(--border-color)] shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg uppercase text-[var(--text-main)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
